        <widget class="QTextBrowser" name="textBrowser_76">
         <property name="geometry">
          <rect>
           <x>830</x>
           <y>10</y>
           <width>531</width>
           <height>341</height>
          </rect>
         </property>
         <property name="html">
          <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;title&gt;Капиллярный метод определения поверхностного натяжения&lt;/title&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'MS Shell Dlg 2'; font-size:8.25pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot; bgcolor=&quot;#ffffff&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;При выходе жидкости из капилляра радиусом &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_t75&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;радиус кривизны поверхности капли сначала убывает, а затем, достигнув минимума, начинает возрастать (рисунок 1.2). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Рисунок_x0020_27&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Р&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;исунок 1.2 – Схема к методу висячей капли&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Для образования поверхности капли необходима затрата определенного количества энергии, эквивалентного силе &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; отнесенной к единице длины &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;формирующейся поверхности. Для капли жидкости сферической формы&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;В&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;ес &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;капли в момент отрыва уравновешивается силой &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;поверхностного натяжения, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; Принимается, что диаметр &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;шейки капли в момент отрыва соответствует диаметру &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;узкого конца трубки. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Таким образом,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;з&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;десь &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; где &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;– масса определенного (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_x0000_i1025&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Calibri','sans-serif'; font-size:10pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:14pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;) количества капель раствора, d – диаметр капилляра, g – ускорение свободного падения.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:8pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
         </property>
        </widget>
       </widget>
